{"availability":"available","full":"srothgan/claude-code-rust","name":"claude-code-rust","description":"A native Rust terminal interface for Claude Code","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":260,"forks":55,"created":"2026-02-08T08:35:24Z","updated":"2026-10-06T17:38:50Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://srothgan.github.io/claude-code-rust/","topics":["agent-sdk","ai","anthropic","claude","claude-code","cli","command-line","crossterm","developer-tools","ratatui","rust","terminal","tui"],"demo":"https://srothgan.github.io/claude-code-rust/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.601Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.601Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.601Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.601Z","stars":260,"forks":55}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A native Rust terminal interface for Claude Code. Drop-in replacement for Anthropic's stock Node.js/React Ink TUI, built for performance and a better user experience.","Claude Code Rust replaces the stock Claude Code terminal interface with a native Rust binary built on Ratatui. It connects to the same Claude API through a local Agent SDK bridge. Core Claude Code functionality works unchanged, including tool calls, file editing, terminal commands, and permissions.","The stock Claude Code TUI runs on Node.js with React Ink, which renders by redrawing full frames over raw ANSI escape codes. Users widely report the following problems with it:"],"features":["Flickering: The whole view is redrawn on every status update, causing constant flicker (bad enough to crash editors' integrated terminals during long sessions)","CPU: Sustained high CPU even when idle, and runaway loops that spawn multiple background processes","Memory: 200-400MB baseline (and climbing with conversation length) vs 20-50MB for a native binary","Resize: Window resizing leaves duplicated frames in scrollback, loses lines when shrinking, and can garble the display","Input latency: Keystrokes echo with visible delay as context fills up, and noticeably worse on Windows"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/srothgan/claude-code-rust/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"39a8c1a6a58ce8b7569489da88d646fd75270e1e493a9d90fcb0e874882966aa","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.749Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.749Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A native Rust terminal interface for Claude Code. Drop-in replacement for Anthropic's stock Node.js/React Ink TUI, built for performance and a better user experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/srothgan/claude-code-rust/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A native Rust terminal interface for Claude Code. Drop-in replacement for Anthropic's stock Node.js/React Ink TUI, built for performance and a better user experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/srothgan/claude-code-rust/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"39a8c1a6a58ce8b7569489da88d646fd75270e1e493a9d90fcb0e874882966aa","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/srothgan/claude-code-rust/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.749Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T17:38:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/srothgan/claude-code-rust/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:37.750Z","hash":"39a8c1a6a58ce8b7569489da88d646fd75270e1e493a9d90fcb0e874882966aa","originalBytes":7874,"storedBytes":7874,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["claude","sdk","agent","code","anthropic","project","terminal","install","rust","see","usage","license","native","claude-rs","including","interface","node.js","source","still","stock","any","bash","changes","claude-code-rust","commands","dependency","documentation","ink","installation","npm","powershell","react","runtime","scrollback","tui","under","about","active","apache-2.0","billing","binary","building","built","bun","commercial","contributing